        "id": 1152670
      },
      "writtenOn": "2025-06-26T09:40:02Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "How does `Field.trySetAccessible()` help avoid exceptions from `Field.get()` ? If `Field.setAccessible(true)` fails, then `Field.get()` wouldn\u0027t be executed anyway. And if `Field.get()` throws an exception even after `Field.setAccessible(true)` succeeds, it would still throw an exception when using `Field.trySetAccessible()`, since it would return true in that case.",
      "parentUuid": "3808d820_44b95bdb",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 9,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 9,
        "endChar": 47
      },
      "revId": "6e6ab1939d84b920d0c42a3484716ba67fb6a5e1",
